<%# Always-visible reminder that this is an AI, with urgent-help info one tap away. %>
<details class="care-note">
  <summary>
    This is an AI character, not a replacement for professional care.
    <span class="care-note-link">Need urgent help?</span>
  </summary>
  <p class="care-note-body">
    If you are in danger or thinking about harming yourself, call your local emergency number right now
    (112 in the EU, 911 in the US) or find a free helpline in your country at
    <%= link_to "findahelpline.com", "https://findahelpline.com", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>.
    You deserve support from a real person too.
  </p>
</details>
